  "$visualsOrder": "The one grid under the title video on Visuals, photos and videos together, in this order. Entries are photo:<id> or video:<id>. Anything left out is added at the end; a video with `feature` is the big one above the grid and is not listed here. Videos take `size` s, m or l (VIDEO_SPANS in build.py).",
